DESCRIPTION:Delta Dogs hosts the 10th Anniversary Mobile Witches Ride on S
 unday\, October 25 from 3:30 PM to 8:00 PM in downtown Mobile. Witches of
  any gender put on a costume and join a three mile\, easy paced bike para
 de that ends at a Black Hat Block Party outside The Blind Mule with music
  and food. Proceeds fund free spay\, neuter and veterinary care for pets 
 of Mobile families in need.\nPrice: $35 per party\nArea: Mobile & Baldwin
